  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.CassandraOASIS v2.0.3\n\nApache Cassandra / ScyllaDB OASIS Provider — wide-column store for OASIS holons and avatars via CassandraCSharpDriver. Compatible with Cassandra 3/4, ScyllaDB, and Amazon Keyspaces. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Add explicit bounded Cassandra CQL admission and lifecycle controls (6e55b18)\n- Integrate verified Apache Cassandra native storage (1bd627b)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Publish Cassandra holon identity only after acknowledged writes (1f9e5b8)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.CassandraOASIS",
